WEBVTT - intro2 - English subtitles
NOTE Literal translation of the Persian narration; timings match the speech.

00:00.780 --> 00:06.580
As I said, several clients have been referred and held their first sessions;

00:06.580 --> 00:11.120
and our therapists — some voluntarily,

00:11.120 --> 00:16.780
and some accepting lower fees — agreed to take part in this work.

00:16.780 --> 00:20.240
My goal in making this video was to ask for help;

00:20.240 --> 00:25.280
if you can help us fund the sessions,

00:25.280 --> 00:29.480
since Kiana's and my own means for financial support are limited;

00:29.480 --> 00:35.580
even paying for one session can make a real difference.

00:35.580 --> 00:41.660
Also, if you know a therapist who would like

00:41.660 --> 00:46.780
to stand with people in these hard days, please tell us.

00:46.780 --> 00:59.780
In these hard days, we only have each other, and we must look out for one another; I hope we receive many messages.
